# ==============================================================================
# DukaanFlow Frontend — Production Environment Variables Template
# ==============================================================================
# Configure these variables in your Vercel Project Settings -> Environment Variables.
#
# IMPORTANT SECURITY WARNING:
# Any variable prefixed with VITE_ will be statically compiled into public JavaScript
# bundles. NEVER put backend secrets, database connection strings, JWT keys, or
# Gemini API keys in this file or Vercel frontend environment variables!
# ==============================================================================

# API Base URL
# Option A (Recommended): Leave empty or set to /api/v1 to use Vercel reverse-proxy
# (same-origin cookie architecture defined in vercel.json).
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api/v1

# Option B (Direct / Custom Domain): If using a separate custom API subdomain with
# CORS & cross-site cookies, specify the full HTTPS URL:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.dukaanflow.in/api/v1
